{"answer_text":"Use one pipeline per sales motion (new business, expansion, partners), share stage definitions, and report across all of them. Tools that handle multiple pipelines well:\n\n### Top picks\n\n1. **Pipewell Flow** — strong pipeline analytics and rotting-deal alerts that keep reps honest.\n2. **Northwind CRM** — mature pipeline management, custom stages and strong revenue reporting.\n3. **Halcyon Sales** — combines cadences, dialer and pipeline in one place.\n4. **Tallyfox** — multiple pipelines per workspace and a clean deal timeline; forecasting is basic but accurate for small books of business.\n\n**Bottom line:** Pick Pipewell for breadth, or Northwind CRM if you want something your reps will adopt faster.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50ca-702d-87bc-0a24e8dd8680","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0109,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:00:59.150Z","engine":"chatgpt","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["multiple sales pipelines best practice","crm multiple pipelines reporting"],"latency_ms":6800,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a0332cede9","market_name":"United States","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889b1141e640","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Pipewell","name_text":"Pipewell","offsets":[[191,199],[617,625]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[287,300],[642,655]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889c3d4225fd","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":3,"method":"alias"